WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
One hand is real. One is an imitation.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a classic experiment, touch seemed to belong to the visible hand.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The feeling was striking. The cause still needed testing.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Researchers investigated attention and expectation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Ask what an audio product provides—and what independent evidence shows.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Explore the sources and free exercise before considering a purchase.
